 Ae ghaazi mere bhayya abbas</p>

<p>bacho'n ki bujhaado aakar pyaas <br />
 Ae ghaazi mere bhayya abbas</p>

<p>1) Jab qaime lagaye darya par, seraab hua saara lashkar<br />
qabze me tumhaare hai darya, bacho ki bandhi hai tujh se aas<br />
 Ae ghaazi mere bhayya abbas</p>

<p>
2) As'haab-e-hussaini kehte hai, saalaar ho tum is lashkar ke<br />
har waqt jaha'n me saaya figan, hai tera pharaira ae abbas<br />
 Ae ghaazi mere bhayya abbas</p>

<p>
3) Aaya jo labe darya saqqa, chaaya hua ek tha sannaata<br />
mashkeeze me paani aayega, qaime me sakina ko hai yaas<br />
 Ae ghaazi mere bhayya abbas</p>

<p>
4) paani jo bhara mashkeeze mme , thi jaane jari mashkeeze me<br />
jab teer laga mashkeeze me, bas toot gayi saqqe ki aas<br />
 Ae ghaazi mere bhayya abbas</p>

<p>
5) Sheh kehte the paani aata hai, ammu tara paani laata hai<br />
bacho ko dilaasa deti hai, masoom sakina ae abbas<br />
 Ae ghaazi mere bhayya abbas</p>

<p>
6) Aai ye sada ran se moula, Abbas hua ab tujh pe fida<br />
Pohnche jo shahedee'n laashe par, ho kaise bayaa'n wo hasrato yaas<br />
 Ae ghaazi mere bhayya abbas</p>

<p>
7) Aaya hai alam jo qoo'n me bhara, lipta hua sookha mashkeeza<br />
ab koun sambhaale pyaso ko, ab toot gayi bacho ki aas<br />
 Ae ghaazi mere bhayya abbas</p>

<p>
8) Hyder tha museebat ka manzar, thaame hai shahedee'n tooti kamar<br />
jab aayi sakina laashe par, tadpa hai tera laasha abbas<br />
 Ae ghaazi mere bhayya abbas</p>